Now implement the proposed the changes. If you see any other space for improvement do it. After you implement changes in code make sure it is
buildable. Then create a new image with ./mvnw spring-boot:build-image and run application with `docker compose down -v && docker compose up -d` and
try to send few curl request just to check if authentication really works. After that go to fix all tests, unit tests and integration tests. I want
you to create new ClientIntegrationTest and AccountIntegrationTest. As final step update test_minibank_api_auth shell script with changes requiring
authentication and add test for each api endpoint and especially check authentication and scenario when multiple users are logged in and are able to
list their's accounts but none of them can see accounts of other users.
